+# Identity audit / caller-attested build proof
+
+serve.rs: health current/node_threads and run_ids emit numeric compatibility run_id plus decimal run_key; status fallback, cancel receipt, run-events fallback and completion admission emit both. /runs inspect/cancel and /run-events parse canonical string request run_id via parse_run_id; numeric inputs restricted JS-safe, signed SQLite range explicitly enforced. Journal inspect/views/replay emit run_key from u64 without JS conversion; scheduler stays internal u64 and delegates durable views to journal.
+
+UI app.js: runKey canonicalizes exact text or safe legacy numeric; baseline, identifySubmittedRun sorting (BigInt), standing/thread match, durable lookup, live reconnect and cancel preserve keys. Diagnostic owner/current ID now uses runKey. Engine component Inspect/Cancel event previously used numeric run_id: fixed to prefer run_key. Event cursors remain separate sequence numbers, not run identities. Legacy numeric outputs retained compatibility only. Steer targets conversation, not rounded run ID.
+
+Executed isolated git archive + working scripts snapshot build (operation op-1791024158953567-13548-2195), cargo jobs2; source hashes frozen before build, equal afterward; binary hash receipt captured AFTER successful build. Normal test-gate-check in archive with rust/target/debug/wa.exe ABSENT used explicit candidate/debug/wa.exe + frozen receipt. exit0, HTTP36/0 skips. Candidate SHA256 569f30855ee26e53e736d8424d284ebe813beed5b7695b43d083ed79346dd8da. Wrong frozen binary binding exit1 (op-1791024345225790-13548-2315). Verification never regenerates expected binding. Caller-attested provenance, not binary introspection/security. Logs no-debug.log and wrong-binding.log retained; private candidate/archive relocated intact to own worktree Git metadata identity-evidence/private-identity (3485 files, hash readback all matched). Original wrong-binding.raw SHA256 9c55272e1c8f930d56573ad478bc80cdc7247f15b5a5187b7a92fdc154cd572f; manifest.json SHA256 2057769c5eafbdb17fcf05e0980d74cb2720651a3fbab3c843fa4d3ef835cacf. Repo text log differs only by removing carriage-return bytes; original absolute paths remain historical evidence. Frozen build receipt remains valid after relocation because hashes are relative and no expected input was recomputed.
+
+This completes narrow HTTP identity evidence, not shared attach/history/folds/oversized/viewport acceptance. Full continuity remains separate next phase.
